 <h2>Tarball</h2>

 <p>All code for Vanilla Pd below 0.42 for quick download - please SEE VERSION INFO in the README file. A few files may not work on newer Pd versions.</p>

 <p><a href="./examples.tar.gz">Download tarball of all files</a></p>
 
 <p>All of the following files are suitable for Pd versions 0.42 and above.</p>

 <ul class="nobullet2">
